<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>blue — memory</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0 }
body { background: #111; color: #ccc; font: 13px/1.6 monospace; display: flex; min-height: 100vh }
a { color: inherit; text-underline-offset: 3px; overflow-wrap: anywhere }
a:hover { opacity: 1 }
nav { width: 133px; flex-shrink: 0; padding: 40px 16px; border-right: 1px solid #cccccc26 }
nav a { display: block; text-decoration: none; line-height: 2.4; opacity: .45 }
nav a.active { opacity: 1 }
main { padding: 32px 40px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; max-width: 1160px }
header, section, .toolbar, .pagination { margin-bottom: 20px }
h1, h2, h3, strong { font: inherit }
h1 { margin-bottom: 4px }
.muted { opacity: .6 }
.tabs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid #cccccc26; padding: 16px 0; margin-bottom: 20px }
.tabs a { text-decoration: none; padding: 6px 0; opacity: .55 }
.tabs a[aria-current="page"] { opacity: 1; border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor }
form { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: end; gap: 10px }
label { display: grid; gap: 4px; min-width: 0; max-width: 100% }
.search { flex: 1 1 240px }
input, select, button { font: inherit; color: inherit; background: #111; border: 1px solid #cccccc55; border-radius: 0; padding: 8px; min-width: 0; max-width: 100% }
select { width: 180px }
button, summary { cursor: pointer }
:focus-visible { outline: 1px solid currentColor; outline-offset: 3px }
.counts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 16px; margin-top: 12px }
.card { border: 1px solid #cccccc26; padding: 12px 16px; margin: 10px 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere }
.row-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 4px 12px; margin-bottom: 8px }
.text { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere; margin: 8px 0 }
.meta { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 100px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 4px 12px; margin: 10px 0 }
dt { opacity: .6 }
dd { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere }
summary { padding: 8px 0 }
pre { font: inherit; white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: anywhere }
.notice { border-left: 1px solid currentColor; padding-left: 12px; margin: 12px 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere }
.pagination { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-top: 20px }
.pagination a { padding: 8px 0 }
.document-list { display: grid; gap: 8px; margin: 12px 0 }
.document-list a { padding: 6px 0 }
@media (max-width: 700px) {
 body { display: block }
 nav { width: 100%; padding: 10px 16px; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #cccccc26; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0 16px }
 main { padding: 16px }
 input, select { font-size: 16px }
 header, section, .toolbar { margin-bottom: 12px }
 .tabs { padding: 8px 0; margin-bottom: 12px }
 .tabs { gap: 4px 16px }
 label:not(.search) { flex: 1 1 140px }
 select { width: 100% }
 .card { padding: 12px }
 .meta { grid-template-columns: 78px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 4px 8px }
}
</style></head><body>
<nav aria-label="主导航">
 <a href="/">Recent Chats</a><a href="/scheduled">Scheduled</a><a href="/tasks">Tasks</a><a href="/sources">Sources</a><a href="/logs">Logs</a><a href="/memory" class="active">Memory</a>
</nav>
<main>
<header><h1>Memory / 记忆与规则</h1><p class="muted">记忆、Agent 规则与系统记录 · 只读</p></header>
<div class="tabs" role="navigation" aria-label="记忆视图">
<% it.views.forEach(function(view) { %><a href="<%= it.link(it.query, {view: view.id, page: 1, record: '', doc: ''}) %>" <% if (it.query.view === view.id) { %>aria-current="page"<% } %>><%= view.label %></a><% }) %>
</div>
<% if (it.diagnostics.length) { %><section class="notice" aria-label="数据诊断"><h2>! 数据诊断</h2><% it.diagnostics.forEach(function(message) { %><p><%= message %></p><% }) %></section><% } %>
<% if (it.query.view === 'structured') { %>
<p class="muted">默认只看当前有效记录，旧版本保留在更正历史中。</p>
<div class="toolbar">
<form method="get" action="/memory">
<input type="hidden" name="view" value="structured">
<label class="search">搜索正文 / 主体 / 来源<input type="search" name="q" maxlength="300" value="<%= it.query.q %>" placeholder="关键词、ID、来源标签或路径"></label>
<label>命名空间<select name="namespace"><option value="">全部</option><% if (it.query.namespace && !it.namespaces.includes(it.query.namespace)) { %><option selected value="<%= it.query.namespace %>"><%= it.query.namespace %>（未找到）</option><% } %><% it.namespaces.forEach(function(namespace) { %><option value="<%= namespace %>" <% if (namespace === it.query.namespace) { %>selected<% } %>><%= namespace %></option><% }) %></select></label>
<label>类型<select name="kind"><option value="">全部</option><% it.kinds.forEach(function(kind) { %><option value="<%= kind %>" <% if (kind === it.query.kind) { %>selected<% } %>><%= kind %></option><% }) %></select></label>
<label>有效状态<select name="status"><% it.statuses.forEach(function(status) { %><option value="<%= status.id %>" <% if (status.id === it.query.status) { %>selected<% } %>><%= status.label %></option><% }) %></select></label>
<label>每页<select name="size"><% [10,20,50].forEach(function(size) { %><option value="<%= size %>" <% if (size === it.query.size) { %>selected<% } %>><%= size %></option><% }) %></select></label>
<button type="submit">筛选</button><a href="/memory">重置</a>
</form>
<div class="counts"><% it.statuses.forEach(function(status) { %><a href="<%= it.link(it.query, {status: status.id, page: 1, record: ''}) %>"><%= status.label %> <%= it.counts[status.id] %></a><% }) %></div>
<p class="muted">匹配 <%= it.matches %> / 共 <%= it.total %> 条 · 按录入时间倒序<% if (!it.complete) { %> · 快照不完整，有效性无法确认<% } %></p>
</div>
<% if (it.query.record) { %>
<section class="notice" id="history"><h2>更正历史 / 跨命名空间</h2><p class="muted">包含前驱、后继及同链分支；不受当前搜索或有效状态过滤，最多 200 条。箭头表示「此记录替代的前驱」。</p><a href="<%= it.link(it.query, {record: ''}) %>">关闭历史 / 返回筛选</a>
<% it.historyDiagnostics.forEach(function(message) { %><p><%= message %></p><% }) %>
<% it.history.forEach(function(row) { %><%~ include('memory-record', {row: row, query: it.query, link: it.link, statusLabel: it.statusLabel, expanded: true}) %><% }) %>
</section><% } %>
<section aria-label="记忆记录">
<% if (!it.rows.length) { %><p class="notice">没有可显示的匹配记录。请检查数据诊断，或切换「全部记录 / 无法确认」；这不表示记忆库一定为空。</p><% } %>
<% it.rows.forEach(function(row) { %><%~ include('memory-record', {row: row, query: it.query, link: it.link, statusLabel: it.statusLabel, expanded: false}) %><% }) %>
</section>
<div class="pagination" aria-label="分页">
<% if (it.page > 1) { %><a rel="prev" href="<%= it.link(it.query, {page: it.page - 1}) %>">&lt; 上一页</a><% } %>
<span>第 <%= it.page %> / <%= it.pages %> 页 · <%= it.matches %> 条</span>
<% if (it.page < it.pages) { %><a rel="next" href="<%= it.link(it.query, {page: it.page + 1}) %>">下一页 &gt;</a><% } %>
</div>
<% } else { %>
<section>
<% if (it.query.view === 'core') { %><h2>Core / 精简常驻记忆</h2><p class="muted">固定来源：skills/file-memory/core.md。普通会话构建 system prompt 时读取；不是 AGENTS.md 规则，也不是完整命名空间内容。</p><% } %>
<% if (it.query.view === 'agents') { %><h2>Agent 规则 / AGENTS.md</h2><details><summary>规则文件的作用范围</summary><p class="muted">运行时 DefaultResourceLoader 的 cwd = workingDir，agentDir = SDK getAgentDir()（默认 ~/.pi/agent，可被环境覆盖）；未关闭 context files。自定义 system prompt 仍附加这些规则。</p><p class="muted">SDK 先读 agentDir，再读 cwd 的祖先到 cwd；每个目录按 AGENTS.override.md → AGENTS.md → AGENTS.MD → CLAUDE.md → CLAUDE.MD 选首个可读文件，并处理嵌套 worktree 遮蔽。本页显示当前 agentDir 与工作区两个固定 AGENTS.md 源，不自动读取其他祖先、chat 或 scratch 文件，不证明某个已运行会话已重载。</p></details><% } %>
<% if (it.query.view === 'system') { %><h2>系统变更日志 / SYSTEM.md</h2><p class="muted">系统操作与环境修改的记录，不是有效记忆。普通会话 prompt 会附加 global 与当前 sessionDir 的 SYSTEM.md；这里只列全局及直接聊天目录，未扫描隔离任务会话。</p><% } %>
<% if (it.query.view === 'archives') { %><h2>历史归档 / MEMORY.md · 已停用</h2><p class="muted">全局和聊天旧档案只读，不参与当前结构化检索，不接受新条目；档案内容不代表当前事实。仅通过允许清单中的不透明 ID 选择，不读取任意路径。</p><% } %>
</section>
<div class="document-list" aria-label="文档清单"><% it.documents.forEach(function(document) { %><a href="<%= it.link(it.query, {doc: document.id, page: 1, record: ''}) %>"><%= document.label %></a><% }) %></div>
<% it.documents.forEach(function(document) { if (document.content !== undefined || document.diagnostic) { %>
<article class="card"><h3><%= document.label %></h3><p class="muted"><%= document.scope %></p><% if (document.diagnostic) { %><p class="notice">! <%= document.diagnostic %></p><% } %><% if (document.content !== undefined) { %><pre class="text"><%= document.content %></pre><% } %></article>
<% } }) %>
<% } %>
<footer class="muted">只读文件快照 · 页面不修改记忆，也不代表运行中的会话已重载规则。</footer>
</main></body></html>
